        "content": "## create_deal\nSelect a Bearer Auth credential on the MCP Server Trigger and a Supabase credential on the HTTP node. Publish this workflow. Connect Claude Desktop through mcp-remote to the production MCP URL shown by n8n.\n\nThe tool calls this same workflow through its Execute Workflow Trigger. Re-select this workflow in create_deal if import changed its ID; this starts the separate execution branch and does not recurse through MCP.",
